    "semantic_summary": "This service acts as a dedicated controller layer within the asset explorer, managing the lifecycle of the OmegaUploadModalComponent. Its primary role is to programmatically instantiate this modal, configure it with a target virtual path, and manage the asynchronous communication flow. It exposes a public API, `openUploadDialog`, which returns an Observable emitting staged asset results upon successful user confirmation."
